    - ``P`` is a permutation matrix of shape ``(..., M, M)``
    - ``L`` is a lower-triangular matrix of shape ``(... M, K)``
    - ``U`` is an upper-triangular matrix of shape ``(..., K, N)``

    with ``K = min(M, N)``

